# Living Lectern's Role target is "up to one other target creature you control" (CR 115.1, 601.2c), so with no other creature
# of Bot1's the ability still has no targets and resolves: it draws a card and creates no Role. Bot2's Memnite is not a candidate
# (it is not Bot1's), and the Lectern cannot target itself ("other"), so Bot1 may only activate with no target.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Living Lectern
Island x4
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Living Lectern.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Living Lectern.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Living Lectern)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Living Lectern.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Living Lectern.Activate()
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Living Lectern
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire; Mox Ruby
